the open and closed door icons. All icons are 32 x 32 pixel images. Icons
may be mailed to me in either Hexadecimal or Binary ... I'll write a program
to convert to Hex, which I can then use directly.

   Note : When reading the icons in binary, 0's are white and 1's are black.

